    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the checklist idea makes sense. one more thing—since it's a lot of people, we're thinking about having a few extra staff members just dedicated to the dietary needs at the buffet line. do you think that's overkill? and if we do it, how should they approach guests to make it feel professional and not awkward, like they're constantly hovering over people?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
