      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Having dedicated staff for dietary needs is not overkill for 500 guests with stated severe allergies; it is a vital safety measure. These \"Dietary Guides\" should approach guests proactively but discreetly, perhaps by circulating or standing near the allergy signage. A professional script like, \"May I assist you in locating items that meet your dietary needs?\" sounds helpful rather than intrusive. This minimizes guesswork for the guest and provides real-time assurance.",
      "source": "target",
